    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-26dc00e8e926791fd4186758",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "引入形式为 G_c(s)=K_P+K_I/s 的积分环节也可用于减小斜坡输入 r(t)=t, t >= 0 下的稳态误差。若未校正系统 G(s) 包含一个积分环节，则由 G_c(s) 引入的附加积分环节将使斜坡输入下的稳态误差为零。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The addition of an integration as G_c(s)=K_P+K_I/s can also be used to reduce the steady-state error for a ramp input r(t)=t, t >= 0. If the uncompensated system G(s) possessed one integration, the additional integration due to G_c(s) would result in a zero steady-state error for a ramp input.",
